+# 第5回 トラバース測量I：画像生成プロンプト
+
+- 使用ツール：組み込み画像生成ツール（image_gen）。
+- 出力先：`materials/slides/第05回_トラバース測量I/illustrations/`。
+- 共通指定：横長16:9、長辺約1600 px、RGB PNG。温かいアイボリー（#FAF9F5付近）の背景、紺（#1F4E79）の線、青緑（#13877B）と橙（#BD512B）の強調。平面的で落ち着いた教科書図版。
+- 文字・数字・ロゴ・透かし・記号列なし。測線・矢印・角の弧・測点・格子など、説明に必要な図形は使用する。実在の製品・企業・地名・人物は描かない。
+- 記録書式は第3回の `生成プロンプト.md` に合わせ、各画像の生成・確認結果と実際に使用したプロンプトを記載した。
+
+## title_hero.png
+
+- 用途：表紙：農地を囲む閉合トラバース。
+- 使用ツール：組み込み画像生成ツール（image_gen）。
+- 出力ファイル：`title_hero.png`。
+- 指定：横長16:9、約1600 × 900 px、RGB PNG。文字・数字・文字列・ロゴ・透かしなし。
+
+### 生成・確認結果
+
+- 2026-10-22：生成して指定フォルダに保存。
+- 生成原画像：PNG／RGB／1672 × 941 px。PillowでRGB変換とLANCZOS縮小を行い、納品寸法を厳密な16:9に統一した。図の内容の修正にはimage_genを使用。
+- 最終画像：PNG／RGB／1600 × 900 px。Pillowで再度開いて全画素を読み込み、形式・モード・寸法・ファイルの存在を確認。
+- やり直した回数：0回（初回生成を除くimage_genによる修正。寸法調整は含めない）。
+- 目視確認：文字・数字・ロゴ・透かし・記号列の混入なし。概念図としての輪郭、矢印、器械の構造を確認。
+- 農地を囲む6頂点・6辺の閉じた測線、各頂点の杭、時計回りに統一された矢印を確認。紺の測線が区画の淡い緑・黄土色より明瞭。
+
+### 使用したプロンプト
+
+```text
+Use case: scientific-educational.
+Create one calm, precise textbook plate for the cover of a surveying lecture on traverse surveying.
+Canvas: landscape 16:9, approximately 1600 x 900 pixels, opaque RGB PNG.
+Style: flat, tidy conceptual illustration, crisp navy outlines #1F4E79 on a uniform warm ivory background near #FAF9F5. Restrained teal #13877B and burnt orange #BD512B accents. No photorealism, no gradients, no dramatic shadows.
+Subject: an overhead view of a small group of agricultural parcels, rice paddies and fields, enclosed by one clear irregular closed polygonal survey traverse. Use subdued sage green and pale ochre for the parcels, with thin pale boundary lines. The navy traverse is the visually dominant element.
+Draw a single continuous closed polygon with six distinct vertices and six straight noncrossing edges. At each vertex place a tiny upright survey stake pictogram; each stake clearly marks the junction of its two adjoining edges. Each polygon edge carries one small navy arrowhead, all following the same clockwise direction, so the traverse reads as a single ordered walk returning to its starting point. Keep the farmland comfortably inside the polygon, and the whole diagram comfortably inside the canvas. Generous ivory margins.
+The only diagram marks allowed are the traverse lines, their arrowheads, and the stake pictograms. No legend, compass rose, scale, annotations, mathematical notation, or strings of symbols. No real places, companies, branded equipment, or people.
+Strict exclusions: no text, no numbers, no letters, no logos, no watermark.
+```
+
+## traverse_chain.png
+
+- 用途：5-1 トラバース測量とは。
+- 使用ツール：組み込み画像生成ツール（image_gen）。初稿生成後、同ツールで画像を編集。
+- 出力ファイル：`traverse_chain.png`。
+- 指定：横長16:9、約1600 × 900 px、RGB PNG。文字・数字・文字列・ロゴ・透かしなし。
+
+### 生成・確認結果
+
+- 2026-10-22：生成して指定フォルダに保存。
+- 生成原画像：PNG／RGB／1672 × 941 px。PillowでRGB変換とLANCZOS縮小を行い、納品寸法を厳密な16:9に統一した。図の内容の修正にはimage_genを使用。
+- 最終画像：PNG／RGB／1600 × 900 px。Pillowで再度開いて全画素を読み込み、形式・モード・寸法・ファイルの存在を確認。
+- やり直した回数：1回（初回生成を除くimage_genによる修正。寸法調整は含めない）。
+- 目視確認：文字・数字・ロゴ・透かし・記号列の混入なし。概念図としての輪郭、矢印、器械の構造を確認。
+- 初稿では中央測点の角の弧が欠けていたため、弧を追加し、器械を中央測点の下側へ移して重なりを解消。最終画像では5測点・4辺、3つの内側の角の弧、各辺の橙の両矢印、測量器械1台とプリズム2個を確認。器械は測点に付随する模式的な挿絵として配置。
+
+### 使用したプロンプト
+
+```text
+Use case: scientific-educational.
+Create one precise, restrained textbook plate explaining traverse surveying as successive measurements of angles and distances.
+Canvas: landscape 16:9, approximately 1600 x 900 pixels, opaque RGB PNG.
+Style: a flat tidy conceptual diagram on uniform warm ivory #FAF9F5, navy #1F4E79 for survey lines and instrument silhouettes, teal #13877B for angular arcs, burnt orange #BD512B for distance double arrows. Crisp consistent lines, restrained pale sector fills, generous margins, no realistic scenery.
+Composition: a continuous open navy zigzag survey chain across the canvas, with five well-separated small round station points and four straight segments. The stations alternate gently between lower and upper positions. No crossing or branching segments.
+At each of the three interior vertices, show a small teal circular arc and very pale teal fan-shaped sector strictly between the two incident survey legs, with its center exactly on that station. Keep the navy legs readable. These arcs represent measured included angles, not free-floating decorative curves.
+For each of the four segments, place a separate slim burnt-orange double-headed distance arrow exactly parallel to that segment, slightly offset outside the angular sectors. Each arrow clearly corresponds to one segment and has an arrowhead at both ends. No numeric labels.
+Add three small simplified surveying equipment silhouettes next to stations: one generic total station correctly mounted on a three-legged tripod near the middle station, and two generic reflector prisms on straight vertical poles near two other stations. The total station has a small telescope between supports on a leveling base. Equipment icons must not conceal station centers or angle arcs. All three tripod legs are separate and connected to a single top mount. Prism heads are simple diamond shapes in small frames.
+No people, brands, real products, decorative symbols, legend, compass rose, or strings of symbols.
+Strict exclusions: no text, no numbers, no letters, no logos, no watermark.
+```
+
+### 修正プロンプト
+
+直前に生成した当該画像1枚を編集対象として使用（`num_last_images_to_include: 1`）。
+
+```text
+Edit this traverse surveying textbook diagram. Preserve the ivory background, wide 16:9 canvas, five navy station points, four navy zigzag segments, all four orange double-headed distance arrows, and the teal angle sectors at the two upper vertices. Preserve the two prism pole silhouettes.
+Correct the missing angle sector at the central lower station: add a teal circular arc centered precisely on that station, between its two upward-sloping navy legs. The arc must be clearly visible above the station, with a very pale teal fan-shaped fill. It must have the same radius and line weight as the sectors at the upper vertices. There must be exactly three clearly visible teal sectors in total, one at each interior vertex.
+Move the total station and its entire tripod away from this angle sector into the empty ivory space immediately BELOW the central station, as a nearby small separate equipment pictogram. Leave a clear ivory gap between this pictogram and the station dot so the measurement geometry is unobscured. Tripod has exactly three connected legs, generic simplified instrument, no tiny button details. Keep everything comfortably inside the frame.
+Flat precise calm navy #1F4E79, teal #13877B, orange #BD512B, ivory #FAF9F5. no text, no numbers, no letters, no logos, no watermark. No strings of symbols, no labels, no people.
+```
+
+## ts_coordinate.png
+
+- 用途：5-6 TSの座標観測。
+- 使用ツール：組み込み画像生成ツール（image_gen）。初稿生成後、同ツールで画像を編集。
+- 出力ファイル：`ts_coordinate.png`。
